---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro'
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro'
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro'
---

<Layout 
  title="Base44 Expert - Specialist Studio for Stuck Base44 Apps"
  description="We solve publish errors, custom domain setup, and production blockers. A specialist studio that gets your Base44 app unstuck and shipped."
>
  <Nav />
  
  <main>
    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-50 to-white section-padding">
      <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="max-w-3xl">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-teal-50 text-teal-700 text-sm font-medium mb-6">
            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-teal-500"></span>
            Base44 Specialist Studio
          </div>
          <h1 class="text-5xl sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 mb-6 text-balance">
            Your Base44 app is stuck. We get it unstuck.
          </h1>
          <p class="text-xl sm:text-2xl text-slate-600 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
            Publish errors. Custom domains. Production blockers. We dig into logs, schemas, and configs to find what's stopping your Base44 app from shipping.
          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4">
            <a 
              href="/contact" 
              class="inline-flex justify-center items-center px-8 py-4 text-base font-semibold rounded-lg text-white bg-teal-700 hover:bg-teal-800 transition-colors shadow-lg shadow-teal-700/20"
            >
              Tell us what's broken
            </a>
            <a 
              href="/work" 
              class="inline-flex justify-center items-center px-8 py-4 text-base font-semibold rounded-lg text-slate-700 bg-white hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors border border-slate-200"
            >
              See how we work
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Problems Section -->
    <section class="section-padding bg-white">
      <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">What we solve</h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 mb-12 max-w-2xl">
          Base44 builds work until they don't. We fix the errors and blockers that stop apps from reaching production.
        </p>
        
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
          <div class="border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-8 hover:border-teal-700 transition-colors bg-white">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-teal-100 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-teal-700" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-3">Publish errors</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              Hit publish, got an error. Or it says published but nothing changed. We check build logs, entity schemas, and connector configs to isolate the cause.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-8 hover:border-teal-700 transition-colors bg-white">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-teal-100 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-teal-700" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M21 12a9 9 0 01-9 9m9-9a9 9 0 00-9-9m9 9H3m9 9a9 9 0 01-9-9m9 9c1.657 0 3-4.03 3-9s-1.343-9-3-9m0 18c-1.657 0-3-4.03-3-9s1.343-9 3-9m-9 9a9 9 0 019-9" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-3">Custom domain setup</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              Works on the Base44 URL, breaks on your domain. We trace DNS records, SSL certs, and redirect chains to get your domain pointed correctly.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-8 hover:border-teal-700 transition-colors bg-white">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-teal-100 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-teal-700" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 7v10c0 2.21 3.582 4 8 4s8-1.79 8-4V7M4 7c0 2.21 3.582 4 8 4s8-1.79 8-4M4 7c0-2.21 3.582-4 8-4s8 1.79 8 4m0 5c0 2.21-3.582 4-8 4s-8-1.79-8-4" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-3">Entity schema problems</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              Data not showing up, or validation errors you can't trace. We work through schema definitions and queries to find the mismatch.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-8 hover:border-teal-700 transition-colors bg-white">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-teal-100 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-teal-700" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-3">Production blockers</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              Worked in preview, breaks in production. API timeouts, assets not loading, forms not submitting. We dig into logs and configurations to isolate it.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Why Choose Us Section -->
    <section class="section-padding bg-slate-50">
      <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center mb-16">
          <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">We only do Base44</h2>
          <p class="text-lg text-slate-600">
            Not a generalist agency. Not a marketplace. A specialist studio focused entirely on Base44 architecture, quirks, and fixes.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
          <div class="text-center">
            <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-teal-700 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
              <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2M9 5a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2M9 5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2m-6 9l2 2 4-4" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-2">Diagnostic first</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-600">
              We don't guess. We read logs, trace schemas, and test endpoints until we know exactly what's broken.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="text-center">
            <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-teal-700 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
              <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-2">Fix and explain</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-600">
              You get the fix plus context: what broke, why it broke, and how to avoid it next time.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="text-center">
            <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-teal-700 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
              <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-2">Fast turnaround</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-600">
              Most issues resolved within 48 hours. Complex cases may take longer, but you'll know upfront.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA Section -->
    <section class="section-padding bg-white">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6">
          Ready to unstick your Base44 app?
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xl text-slate-600 mb-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          Tell us what's broken and we'll take a look. No cost for the initial diagnostic.
        </p>
        <a 
          href="/contact" 
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-8 py-4 text-base font-semibold rounded-lg text-white bg-teal-700 hover:bg-teal-800 transition-colors shadow-lg shadow-teal-700/20"
        >
          Get in touch
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3" />
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
